## 六、可选：nginx 反向代理

> 两种部署方式**默认不需要 nginx**（Go 直接对外 9080）。仅当你需要 `80/443` 入口、HTTPS、或多个域名统一入口时，再加这一层。Go 服务保持 9080，nginx 反代过去。

### 6.1 安装 nginx

```bash
sudo apt install -y nginx
sudo systemctl enable --now nginx
```

### 6.2 反代配置（方式一/方式二通用）

新建 `/etc/nginx/conf.d/{{ .ProjectName }}.conf`：

```nginx
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name {{ .ProjectName }}.example.com;

    client_max_body_size 20m;      # 请求体上限，按实际需要调整

    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9080;   # Docker 方式同样反代到宿主机 9080
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto $scheme;
        proxy_connect_timeout 60s;
        proxy_read_timeout 60s;
        proxy_send_timeout 60s;
    }
}
```

```bash
sudo nginx -t && sudo systemctl reload nginx
```

> **为什么全部 `location /` 反代给 Go**：Go 自己区分 API/静态/SPA 回退，nginx 无需拆 location、无需自配静态目录。

### 6.3 HTTPS（可选 443）

```nginx
server {
    listen 443 ssl;
    server_name {{ .ProjectName }}.example.com;
    ssl_certificate     /etc/nginx/ssl/{{ .ProjectName }}.pem;
    ssl_certificate_key /etc/nginx/ssl/{{ .ProjectName }}.key;
    client_max_body_size 20m;
    location / {
        proxy_pass http://127.0.0.1:9080;
        proxy_set_header Host $host;
        proxy_set_header X-Real-IP $remote_addr;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-For $proxy_add_x_forwarded_for;
        proxy_set_header X-Forwarded-Proto https;
    }
}
server {
    listen 80;
    server_name {{ .ProjectName }}.example.com;
    return 301 https://$host$request_uri;
}
```

